<title>ITALY: Italy air controllers call off threatened strike.</title>
<headline>Italy air controllers call off threatened strike.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian air traffic controllers, who had threatened to strike on Monday, have called off their action after talks with the Transport Ministry.</p>
<p>Newspapers reported on Sunday that the threatened strike, from June 23 to 26 over contractual disagreements, had been cancelled after an agreement reached on Saturday.</p>
<p>((-- Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2501))</p>
